# Verified original opening with maintenance puzzle and both receptionist trades.
# Produces a real GATE001.SAV called OFFICEFULL in the run's state directory.
COMMAND open drawer
COMMAND take all
ASSERT_LOCATION 123 d3
ASSERT_LOCATION 126 d3
LABEL initial_items
COMMAND read book
COMMAND put card in slot
MENU_KEYS 1,N,N,0,0
COMMAND east
COMMAND north
COMMAND north
COMMAND take rose
ASSERT_LOCATION 13f d3
LABEL maintenance_rose
COMMAND flip lever
COMMAND wait
COMMAND wait
COMMAND wait
COMMAND wait
COMMAND put screwdriver in toolbox
COMMAND wait
COMMAND wait
COMMAND put wrench in toolbox
COMMAND wait
COMMAND wait
COMMAND put pliers in toolbox
COMMAND wait
COMMAND wait
LABEL tool_job_done
COMMAND south
COMMAND south
COMMAND northwest
COMMAND give rose to receptionist
ASSERT_LOCATION 13a d3
LABEL receptionist_magazine
COMMAND read magazine
COMMAND give book to receptionist
ASSERT_LOCATION 123 0
ASSERT_LOCATION 130 d3
LABEL office_both_exchanges
COMMAND save
TYPE OFFICEFULL
KEY enter
LABEL office_saved
